{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "5621b5bef12ca2c8263f998cfbf387c8cc7a4a3122cdf48df76aedcd6fb0eed2", "ja": "お姫さまたちの冒険", "zh": "公主们的冒险", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fede49f947e1adf6d87f4c7c348b26c738b4740c72136b2d8907889cd1ae3464", "ja": "夜の誰もいないステージを見に行った百合子\n達は舞台の静寂と広さに怯えてしまう。\nしかし、真の一言で、この広さは自分達の\nパワーを受け入れるためなのだと気づき、\n安心感を抱き公演が楽しみで仕方なくなる。", "zh": "百合子等人去看了深夜无人的舞台，\n却因为舞台的寂静与宽敞而心生畏缩。\n但真说出的一句话，让她们发觉到\n宽敞的舞台是为了承受自己的能量以后，\n她们便放下不安，满心期待着公演的到来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e9af565ae7b1f7c5ef36baaacdd56d0dd2a02dabd4f7dd481b58a25c2023e277", "ja": "（長いようで短かった合宿も、ついに最終日を迎えた）", "zh": "（似长而短的集训，也终于到了最后一天。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "45e9d81c93f5c40256b9cba28cc8c179a91e60cc7da5534bd89f1bf5cca3721b", "ja": "えへ、美奈子さんの打ち上げ晩ご飯、美味しかった～。\nやまもりごはんに～、おかずもいっぱい～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，美奈子的庆功晚餐，真是好吃～\n饭装得像一座小山，配菜也夹不完～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "821d274c305cba5dc0da611a1edc107a7e0098dffd43871ed0ebc743b9f303fc", "ja": "エネルギー補給はバッチリみたいだな。\nあとは初日に向けて、ゆっくり休んでくれよ！", "zh": "好像正适合补给能量呢。\n接着就是好好休息，准备迎接第一天了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "270b92537c76c9e3a052efb29817f790a16c8831b19ffe076c13a60a6dbab5c5", "ja": "格闘技でも、休憩は大切なトレーニングなんだよね。\nそういう意味でも、合宿ってすっごくいいと思うんだ。", "zh": "在格斗技当中，休息也是训练重要的一环呢。\n从这个角度来看，我觉得这个集训办得相当成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "b956a8f10d454fb231cbf270b9721a0e829b730d2ffc15ba8e07579f155438c3", "ja": "ほら、ハードなレッスンが終わっても、\nすぐにバタンキューできるから。気持ちよかったな～♪", "zh": "你们懂吧，就算结束了艰难的训练课程，\n也能马上睡得死死的。真是太舒服了啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "33ab68c8057fbfc2050238bac35e104962168cc7637acd0247c5752a12a660ac", "ja": "私もこの合宿で、みなさんと今まで以上に仲良くさせて\nもらえて……これぞ和の心だと、改めて気づけました。", "zh": "我也在这次的集训当中，和大家变得\n比以前更要好了……让我再次发觉，这就是大和之心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "66fa2c3bc536b4aaba2d688e7887b36b40d7e086a753d8d557ae95189143d7f4", "ja": "おかげさまで、また一歩、大和撫子に近づけた気が\nします♪　ありがとうございます、仕掛け人さま！", "zh": "托您的福，我觉得自己又靠近大和抚子一些了♪\n谢谢您，策划执行人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c765ca3ac364d2d6e6e0b34323c52d3bd46a940e8107a686dbddc74a27b1ccb2", "ja": "とんでもない。合宿を思いついたのは未来達だし、\n実現できたのは、みんなの熱意の賜物だよ。", "zh": "千万别这么说。想到集训这点子的人是未来她们，\n能够实现也是拜大家的热诚所赐喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "083c280afba24be0118b7e1db0e40cb76571f8bd8be5a86cf6898031e8a20125", "ja": "本当に、私もこの合宿に参加できてよかったと\n思います。こんな物語、想像してなかったな……。", "zh": "我也很庆幸自己能参加集训。\n我从来没有想过这样的故事发展呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "653484d2e5a95373cc67a0518a60ecf2e7760fcd515ead9265d1ff87969cc068", "ja": "だっていつもなら、もうパジャマでベッドの上にいる\n頃合いですよ？　なのに、今もこうしてみんなと……。", "zh": "换做平时的话，我早就穿着睡衣躺在床上了，\n但现在，我还在这边和大家一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa4234a9e10f34f2d3e9b1300cd0254197ff5031cda8a124c5017f0f366a1ac2", "ja": "そうだっ。\nあの～、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "对了！\n那个～{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e16373aa49a3c40c46c40033b9741442f332078d54aeffbaf4ac806b36586712", "ja": "？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "9f76e8517e84909ce064c0291efff40a457d6a3d85c5ded557d6e648ac363b27", "ja": "実は私……、\nちょっと行ってみたいところがあるんです。", "zh": "其实我……\n想去一个地方看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "4a9ce30a2157fd2c63f14c8352ec45c9a9429645eb8d3dca8629f51102b05239", "ja": "こ、こわくない～？\nお化けとかいない～……？", "zh": "不、不会可怕吗～？\n会不会有鬼啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "dec3473c0c6b70019f9052a38c0c223bb04d2c488b1b646f40239e0b7b4f093c", "ja": "大丈夫、怪人が住み着いてる気配はないよ！\nほら、目を開けてみて、可奈ちゃん。", "zh": "别担心，感觉没有魅影住在这里！\n来，把眼睛睁开看看，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "4ef8258dddc571131f1253d1eb7efb8f9ab012c2ca7b39e651a59629361e7097", "ja": "わぁ～っ。\nなんか……すごいね、百合子ちゃん……。", "zh": "哇～！\n感觉……好壮观喔，百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "60a7d0d7501d5c1ce2c9945d5504c3d57f4a51b7fc4a10c4600b1ed2dd423671", "ja": "いつものステージとは、別物みたいだよね。\nあんなに賑やかなのに、こんなに静かで……。", "zh": "跟平时的舞台完全不一样呢。\n平时那么热闹，现在却静成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "a4027d49322b065ca1127419261678ae8e0ab00f2f227bc4a98e1b751a9f3616", "ja": "それに、いつもより広いようにも感じます……。\nは、はぅ……。", "zh": "而且感觉也比平时更宽敞了……\n啊、呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "483eb00de0f9a1e41bd95fe5963c48acfd547d84021bb7f66beee614e6e1aec3", "ja": "俺も、こんな遅い時間にステージまで来たのは\n初めてだな……。", "zh": "我也是第一次\n在这种深夜来到舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "3d021180b2d0f17092bd8c50ab43885c5aa0ce34d813aa77d13db305bd315d22", "ja": "な、なにか新しい物語が待っている気がして、来てみた\nけど……夜のステージは、予想以上にホラーです……！", "zh": "我、我想说或许会遇见什么新的故事，所以跑来看看，\n不过……夜晚的舞台，超乎想像地惊悚……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1020_se", "source_sha256": "dbeb7e1c36454d990ce2215920639d1aa797206d2c8848d8e03676fe17de9c13", "ja": "ガタンッ！", "zh": "碰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "4bf8d8dbe6ee7d3f13c5fe431d6f41ddec837fc5b20b77a18695df7e3586d594", "ja": "ひゃんっ！　な、なに！？", "zh": "呀！怎、怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "c680c21679d0c3d12fae29f468631cefb2c92d1526b817a3bfb3e922557f1f7d", "ja": "うわぁん！　{$P$}さん～！", "zh": "哇～！{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1023_se", "source_sha256": "5b3696a6d7a5a7798d4d2ed7655aec86385640ca73f3b9fc000d3fd19d4780ae", "ja": "ごそごそ……", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "1b086b35591e239ee34cba80e9a8ce0ec25f731a746bca724c9886bf97e8a96f", "ja": "し、仕掛け人さま、どうしたらいいんですか……？", "zh": "策、策划执行人先生，我们该怎么办才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1aedd54d12e3618198e6a08144e02ba1def18f21be34427ba38f7eb4f9a6c2e6", "ja": "よ、よし。任せておけ。\nおーい、そこに誰かいるのかー？", "zh": "好、好吧，交给我。\n喂～有人在那里吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "87a84bf217e86555d5c19f8af9880af576f18bca974ec30bc64a561699c4fa13", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}じゃないですか。\nそれに、みんなも！", "zh": "奇怪，这不是{$P$}吗？\n大家也都在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "41725feb088096a8601f5f98279c5a64a0f86f5bbdce8e7150693e84ea6ac3cd", "ja": "真！　なんでこんなところに？", "zh": "真！你怎么会在这？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "47bed655d286bc72b0c1a332846a9ac2edbd02eb03b2dc55ae8a3ecaf6b8ad07", "ja": "ライブ用の小物が届いたんで、運んでおこうと思って。\nみんなこそ、どうしてここに？", "zh": "演唱会要用的小道具送到了，在下就想先把东西搬过来。\n你们才是，怎么会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "f1aaeb527626e931baa9bd167bed565fefcace402767af13c053332f1683ff1a", "ja": "その、夜のステージを見ようと思って来てみたんです。\nそしたら、吸い込まれそうなほど広くって……。", "zh": "那个，我们想来看看夜晚的舞台。\n结果发现，舞台大得像要把人吸进去一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "728c99639b3dc389b82525a81b93d06459e64f626a4680befc6b4cbca99a7286", "ja": "あはは、それで震えてたんだ？\nしょうがないなぁ。でも、大丈夫だよ！", "zh": "啊哈哈，所以才在发抖啊？\n真拿你们没办法。不过，用不着担心啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "a49402a4c66e6b3b9cd04953514377f80c99a9b283695bb6484a858c4eb42c55", "ja": "ほら、勇気を出して見回してごらん。\nこんなに広くて高くて……とっても気持ちいいよ！", "zh": "来，试着鼓起勇气看看四周。\n这么高又这么宽敞……感觉其实很舒畅喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "8aed90a6328de79691f46f2018cd75530223bef0af4dde3c2c38c31952fa6fd5", "ja": "この舞台の上で、スポットライトを浴びられるのは、\nこの世界で唯一、ボク達だけなんだ。それって……。", "zh": "站在舞台、沐浴在镁光灯之下的人，\n就只有这世上独一无二的我们。你们不觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "00b69b426d2ac2d41bb4110a3702806b1f49b2d4861ee5072c3212ff9604a799", "ja": "とっても、素敵なことじゃないかな！", "zh": "这是一件非常棒的事情吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "99bdeb482af9b8af0ef4a6bb883cc39885077a79d0d5f860cf77830aa5aaacc8", "ja": "真さん……（さま……）。", "zh": "真……（小姐……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
