{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "30ff7e2e64a704a937b10a3ed6419fe51dad4208874a6e81520050563d448d9d", "ja": "本番は、ここからボク達のダンスと歌を届けようね。\n燃えろ！　ボクらのプリンセスパワー！", "zh": "正式登台时，要从这里将我们的舞蹈和歌声传给观众喔。\n燃烧吧！我们的公主之力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "c9f88ba5ce6370fe3ac14483acebd0029c5ef0cb6c628dc28355927cc0c92e50", "ja": "そっか。ステージがこんなに広いのは、アタシたちの\nフルパワーを全部、受け入れるためなんだよね！", "zh": "原来，舞台会这么宽敞，\n是为了承受我们的浑身解数啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "f50b73e6c8685a126b094c78fd8fab3de72ee36d6e288fd8013590fef78af8e3", "ja": "この劇場の広さは、{$P$}さんから\n私たちへの、期待と信頼の証……！", "zh": "这座剧场有多大，就代表{$P$}先生\n对我们的期待和信任有多大……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "0fe9aa322cbddd9816d746fd8c102caed85959b7ae56615334375c4e6c0f186e", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……、そこまで私たちのことを……。\n私、仕掛け人さまに一生ついてまいります！", "zh": "策划执行人先生……居然这么看重我们……\n我这辈子都会跟随策划执行人先生的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "f78ca637118309d7d45c7039cc5c4b4d42e63703b697785cd711fa14366d931f", "ja": "私も、もうお化けなんて怖くないですっ！\nみんなの歌で～劇場をいっぱいに～♪", "zh": "我也不会再害怕妖魔鬼怪了！\n让大家的歌声～充满整座剧场～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "64d922970850c2428fd5bb1204a6eecfb7f457573c9a0f2125d9ad0ae85f1e07", "ja": "（先輩の一言で、すっかり奮い立ったみたいだな。\nありがとう、真）", "zh": "（大家因为前辈的一句话，都被点燃斗志了呢。\n谢谢你，真。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "71e04bae0dc5e9c38c8c2aed3e9548eb70897c66831626c3582fa17d43e699dd", "ja": "（たとえ何かに恐れることがあったとしても……、\n彼女たちなら、力を合わせて乗り越えられるだろう）", "zh": "（即便内心深处有恐惧……\n她们一定也能合力跨越困境。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "a23a13d7c1d58e97030a2a0eec9da75af41d7dcdf90272f4c4a2d59703aa42bc", "ja": "（このステージで、どんな困難も\n喜びと楽しさに変えて……！）", "zh": "（在这个舞台上，\n将所有的难关转变成喜悦和欢乐……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
